Subject: [PATCH 2162/3799] soh: rename D_80907084 -> sSwordTrailTipVtx

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the eleven gGanonSwordTrailVtx indices fed from the recorded sword-tip trail
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2_data.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c     | 6 +++---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2_data.c    | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c
